msgid "Security issues need your attention"
msgstr "安全性問題需要你注意"

msgid "A vulnerable component is installed"
msgstr "已安裝存在漏洞的元件"

msgid "Malware is waiting for you to act"
msgstr "惡意軟體正等你處理"

msgid "You can change this later under Settings."
msgstr "你之後可以在 [設定] 中變更這項選擇。"

msgid ""
"The fix could not be applied. Open the feature tab and switch it on there."
msgstr "無法套用這項修正。請開啟該功能的分頁並在該處開啟它。"

msgid ""
"Setting saved. Your page cache is still serving the old response, so this "
"row will clear once the cache refreshes."
msgstr "設定已儲存。你的頁面快取仍在提供舊的回應，這一列會在快取重新整理後清除。"

msgid "Applying..."
msgstr "正在套用..."

msgid ""
"%1$s moves from %2$s to %3$s. This is a major version change and can break "
"your site."
msgstr "%1$s 將從 %2$s 更新至 %3$s。這是主要版本變更，可能導致網站無法運作。"

msgid "No update available"
msgstr "沒有可用的更新"

msgid "Vulnerable"
msgstr "存在漏洞"

msgid "Outdated"
msgstr "已過期"

msgid "Update"
msgstr "更新"

msgid ""
"The setting could not be saved. Open the feature tab and switch it on there."
msgstr "無法儲存這項設定。請開啟該功能的分頁並在該處開啟它。"

msgid "That feature is not available on this installation."
msgstr "這項功能在這個安裝上無法使用。"

msgid ""
"This server re-adds the header after the plugin removes it. Open the feature"
" tab for the server-level fix."
msgstr "這部伺服器會在外掛移除標頭後重新加上它。請開啟該功能的分頁，套用伺服器層級的修正。"

msgid "This item cannot be switched on from here."
msgstr "這個項目無法從這裡開啟。"

msgid "Notify me on malware findings and security threats on this website."
msgstr "這個網站出現惡意軟體及安全性威脅時通知我。"

msgid ""
"The email address for security alerts: the WordPress admin email, or the one"
" you enter below, together with your email alerts choice."
msgstr "接收安全性通知的電子郵件地址：WordPress 網站管理員的電子郵件地址，或你在下方輸入的地址，並依你的電子郵件通知選擇而定。"

msgid "Temporary deactivation"
msgstr "暫時停用"

msgid "Found better alternative"
msgstr "找到更好的替代方案"

msgid "No longer needed"
msgstr "已經不需要"

msgid "It is causing issues"
msgstr "它造成問題"

msgid "Missing feature"
msgstr "缺少需要的功能"

msgid "Why are you deactivating Segurium?"
msgstr "你為什麼要停用 Segurium？"

msgid "Segurium Cloud could not clean this file right now. Try again later."
msgstr "Segurium 雲端目前無法清理這個檔案。請稍後再試。"

msgid "No clean version of this file exists. Remove or replace it by hand."
msgstr "這個檔案沒有乾淨的版本。請手動移除或取代它。"

msgid "Outcome"
msgstr "結果"

msgid "Recent cloud requests"
msgstr "最近的雲端要求"

msgid "Switched off in wp-config.php by SEGURIUM_DISABLE_REMOTE_ACTIONS."
msgstr "已由 wp-config.php 中的 SEGURIUM_DISABLE_REMOTE_ACTIONS 關閉。"

msgid ""
"Segurium Cloud can ask this site to update a plugin, theme, or WordPress "
"itself. It can only name a component you already have installed, and only "
"when WordPress.org already offers that update; the update is downloaded by "
"WordPress from WordPress.org, never from Segurium. WordPress core is limited"
" to security and maintenance releases. Segurium never updates itself this "
"way. Turn this off and the site stops asking for and accepting these "
"requests."
msgstr ""
"Segurium 雲端可以要求這個網站更新外掛、佈景主題或 WordPress 本身。它只能指名你已經安裝的元件，而且僅限 WordPress.org "
"已提供該更新時；更新由 WordPress 從 WordPress.org 下載，絕不會從 Segurium 下載。WordPress "
"核心程式僅限安全性及維護版本。Segurium 絕不會用這種方式更新自己。關閉這項設定後，這個網站就會停止提出及接受這類要求。"

msgid "Let Segurium Cloud request component updates"
msgstr "允許 Segurium 雲端要求更新元件"

msgid "Remote actions require authentication."
msgstr "遠端動作需要驗證。"

msgid "Remote actions are switched off for this site."
msgstr "這個網站的遠端動作已關閉。"

msgid ""
"Website hacked? Free malware removal and antivirus scan for WordPress: clean"
" infected files, restore them. Firewall, brute force, 2FA included."
msgstr "網站被駭？WordPress 免費惡意軟體清除與病毒掃描：清理受感染的檔案並還原。內含防火牆、暴力密碼破解防護與兩步驟驗證。"

msgid ""
"Segurium – Free Malware Removal & Antivirus Scanner, Hacked Website Cleanup,"
" Firewall, 2FA"
msgstr "Segurium – 免費惡意軟體清除與病毒掃描器、被駭網站清理、防火牆、兩步驟驗證"

msgid ""
"Deletion refused: \"%s\" is a protected file. The web server or another "
"plugin may load it, and removing it can take the whole site down. Delete it "
"manually if you are certain it is safe."
msgstr "已拒絕刪除：「%s」是受保護的檔案。網頁伺服器或另一個外掛可能會載入它，移除它可能導致整個網站無法運作。如果你確定安全無虞，請手動刪除。"

msgid "Component version not recognized. %d file cannot be verified."
msgid_plural "Component version not recognized. %d files cannot be verified."
msgstr[0] "無法辨識元件版本。%d 個檔案無法驗證。"

msgid "No automatic fix for verdict \"%s\"."
msgstr "判定結果「%s」沒有自動修正方式。"

msgid "Could not save your choice. Please try again."
msgstr "無法儲存你的選擇。請再試一次。"

msgid ""
"The progress display hit a script error and stopped updating. Reload the "
"page to see the current state — the scan itself is unaffected. Details are "
"in the browser console."
msgstr "進度顯示發生指令碼錯誤並停止更新。請重新載入頁面以查看目前狀態 — 掃描本身不受影響。詳細資料位於瀏覽器主控台。"

msgid "Scan in progress..."
msgstr "掃描進行中..."

msgid "Unknown review prompt action."
msgstr "無法辨識的評論提示動作。"

msgid ""
"If Segurium is doing its job, would you leave an honest review on "
"WordPress.org? It takes a minute."
msgstr "如果 Segurium 有做好它的工作，你願意在 WordPress.org 留下誠實的評論嗎？只需要一分鐘。"

msgid "Scan complete. Your site is clean."
msgstr "掃描完成。你的網站是乾淨的。"

msgid ""
"Glad we could help. If Segurium saved you time or money today, an honest "
"review on WordPress.org helps other site owners find it, and helps us keep "
"the cleanup tier free."
msgstr ""
"很高興我們幫得上忙。如果 Segurium 今天為你省下時間或金錢，在 WordPress.org "
"留下誠實的評論可以幫助其他網站擁有者找到它，也幫助我們維持清理方案免費。"

msgid "Segurium just cleaned your site."
msgstr "Segurium 剛剛清理了你的網站。"

msgid "Don't ask again"
msgstr "不要再詢問"

msgid "Leave a review"
msgstr "留下評論"

msgid "Downloaded file does not match the checksum in the response."
msgstr "下載的檔案與回應中的總和檢查碼不符。"

msgid "Segurium Cloud response is missing the file checksum."
msgstr "Segurium 雲端的回應缺少檔案總和檢查碼。"

msgid "Segurium Cloud returned file content that is not valid base64."
msgstr "Segurium 雲端傳回的檔案內容不是有效的 base64。"

msgid "Segurium Cloud response is missing the file content."
msgstr "Segurium 雲端的回應缺少檔案內容。"

msgid "Segurium Cloud returned error %d."
msgstr "Segurium 雲端傳回錯誤 %d。"

msgid "Invalid response from Segurium Cloud."
msgstr "Segurium 雲端傳回無效的回應。"

msgid "Cleaned file does not match the checksum in the cleanup response."
msgstr "清理後的檔案與清理回應中的總和檢查碼不符。"

msgid "Cleanup response is missing the checksum of the cleaned file."
msgstr "清理回應缺少清理後檔案的總和檢查碼。"

msgid "Segurium Cloud returned cleanup content that is not valid base64."
msgstr "Segurium 雲端傳回的清理內容不是有效的 base64。"

msgid "Invalid cleanup response from Segurium Cloud."
msgstr "Segurium 雲端傳回無效的清理回應。"

msgid "Segurium Cloud"
msgstr "Segurium 雲端"

msgid ""
"When enabled, file contents may be shared with Segurium Cloud for advanced "
"malware detection and cloud-powered cleanup. Only suspicious files are "
"transmitted. Turn it off for On-premise mode: scans then send SHA-256 "
"hashes, file paths, and metadata only, and a file the cloud cannot identify "
"by hash stays unresolved. Reporting a false positive or attaching a file to "
"a support ticket still sends that file, because you pick it yourself."
msgstr ""
"啟用後，檔案內容可能會分享給 Segurium 雲端，以進行進階惡意軟體偵測及雲端清理。只有可疑檔案會傳送。關閉它即進入自架模式：掃描屆時只會傳送 "
"SHA-256 "
"雜湊值、檔案路徑及中繼資料，雲端無法憑雜湊值識別的檔案則維持未判定狀態。回報誤判或在技術支援單附加檔案時仍會傳送該檔案，因為檔案是由你自己挑選的。"

msgid ""
"File samples uploaded for analysis are kept for up to 365 days and then "
"removed by an automated nightly purge. A sample may be removed sooner once "
"it has been reviewed."
msgstr "為了分析而上傳的檔案樣本最多保留 365 天，之後由每晚自動執行的清除工作移除。樣本經過審閱後可能提早移除。"

msgid "Segurium Cloud consent is required before scanning."
msgstr "掃描前必須先取得 Segurium 雲端的同意。"

msgid ""
"On-premise mode is enabled: file contents stay on this server, and any file "
"the cloud cannot identify by hash goes unresolved. Turn on cloud-assisted "
"detection for full accuracy."
msgstr "自架模式已啟用：檔案內容留在這部伺服器上，雲端無法憑雜湊值識別的檔案則維持未判定狀態。請開啟雲端輔助偵測以取得完整準確度。"

msgid "Segurium Cloud (%s): signature did not verify."
msgstr "Segurium 雲端 (%s)：簽章未通過驗證。"

msgid "Segurium Cloud (%1$s): libsodium rejected the signature (%2$s)."
msgstr "Segurium 雲端 (%1$s)：libsodium 拒絕了這個簽章 (%2$s)。"

msgid ""
"Segurium Cloud (%1$s): signature timestamp is %2$d seconds out of range."
msgstr "Segurium 雲端 (%1$s)：簽章時間戳記超出範圍 %2$d 秒。"

msgid "Segurium Cloud (%s): signature timestamp malformed."
msgstr "Segurium 雲端 (%s)：簽章時間戳記格式錯誤。"

msgid "Segurium Cloud (%s): signature header malformed."
msgstr "Segurium 雲端 (%s)：簽章標頭格式錯誤。"

msgid "Segurium Cloud (%1$s): signed with an untrusted key \"%2$s\"."
msgstr "Segurium 雲端 (%1$s)：以未受信任的金鑰「%2$s」簽署。"

msgid "Segurium Cloud (%s): missing signature headers."
msgstr "Segurium 雲端 (%s)：缺少簽章標頭。"

msgid "Segurium Cloud (%s): no response to verify."
msgstr "Segurium 雲端 (%s)：沒有可驗證的回應。"

msgid "Invalid billing response from Segurium Cloud."
msgstr "Segurium 雲端傳回無效的帳單回應。"

msgid "unknown"
msgstr "不明"

msgid ""
"Segurium requires WordPress %1$s or higher. This site is running WordPress "
"%2$s. Please update WordPress, then try activating Segurium again."
msgstr ""
"Segurium 需要 WordPress %1$s 以上版本。這個網站執行的是 WordPress %2$s。請更新 "
"WordPress，然後再次嘗試啟用 Segurium。"

msgid ""
"Segurium requires PHP %1$s or higher. This site is running PHP %2$s. Please "
"ask your host to upgrade PHP, then try activating Segurium again."
msgstr ""
"Segurium 需要 PHP %1$s 以上版本。這個網站執行的是 PHP %2$s。請要求你的主機商升級 PHP，然後再次嘗試啟用 "
"Segurium。"

msgid "Plugin Activation Error"
msgstr "外掛啟用錯誤"

msgid "Cleanup unavailable."
msgstr "無法進行清理。"

msgid "Missing parameter: %s"
msgstr "缺少參數：%s"

msgid "No Wordfence 2FA data found"
msgstr "找不到 Wordfence 的兩步驟驗證資料"

msgid "Import into Segurium 2FA"
msgstr "匯入 Segurium 兩步驟驗證"

msgid "Import %d user(s) with TOTP"
msgstr "匯入 %d 位使用 TOTP 的使用者"

msgid "No manual IP blocks found in Wordfence."
msgstr "在 Wordfence 中找不到手動封鎖的 IP 位址。"

msgid "No country blocks configured in Wordfence."
msgstr "Wordfence 中未設定國家/地區封鎖。"

msgid "No exclusion patterns configured in Wordfence."
msgstr "Wordfence 中未設定排除模式。"

msgid ""
"Segurium geo-blocking (available) — configure manually in the Geo Blocking "
"tab."
msgstr "Segurium 地區封鎖 (可使用) — 請在 [地區封鎖] 分頁手動設定。"

msgid "Segurium WAF rules (planned)"
msgstr "Segurium WAF 規則 (規劃中)"

msgid "WAF Rules"
msgstr "WAF 規則"

msgid ""
"Sucuri Security stores its WAF rules, geo-blocking, and malware scanning "
"settings in the Sucuri cloud dashboard. These cannot be imported locally."
msgstr "Sucuri Security 將它的 WAF 規則、地區封鎖及惡意軟體掃描設定存放在 Sucuri 雲端控制台，這些設定無法在本機匯入。"

msgid "Cloud-Managed Settings"
msgstr "雲端管理的設定"

msgid "No banned IPs found in Solid Security."
msgstr "在 Solid Security 中找不到封鎖的 IP 位址。"

msgid "Banned IPs"
msgstr "已封鎖的 IP 位址"

msgid ""
"Solid Security stores country blocks in the cloud dashboard. Configure "
"manually in the Geo Blocking tab."
msgstr "Solid Security 將國家/地區封鎖存放在雲端控制台。請在 [地區封鎖] 分頁手動設定。"

msgid "Segurium 2FA (planned)"
msgstr "Segurium 兩步驟驗證 (規劃中)"

msgid "No file exclusions configured in AIOS."
msgstr "AIOS 中未設定檔案排除項目。"

msgid "Scan Exclusions"
msgstr "掃描排除項目"

msgid "Merge"
msgstr "合併"

msgid "No banned IPs configured in AIOS."
msgstr "AIOS 中未設定封鎖的 IP 位址。"

msgid "Blocked IPs"
msgstr "已封鎖的 IP 位址"

msgid ""
"AIOS country blocking is a paid cloud feature and cannot be imported "
"locally."
msgstr "AIOS 的國家/地區封鎖是付費雲端功能，無法在本機匯入。"

msgid "Country Blocking"
msgstr "國家/地區封鎖"

msgid "Segurium brute force protection (planned)"
msgstr "Segurium 暴力密碼破解防護 (規劃中)"

msgid "Brute Force Protection"
msgstr "暴力密碼破解防護"

msgid ""
"AIOS IP whitelist (bypass) has no direct equivalent in Segurium's deny-list "
"firewall mode. Configure manually if needed."
msgstr "AIOS 的 IP 允許清單 (略過) 在 Segurium 的拒絕清單防火牆模式中沒有直接對應項目。如有需要請手動設定。"

msgid "IP Whitelist"
msgstr "IP 允許清單"

msgid "2FA reset for user %s."
msgstr "已重設使用者 %s 的兩步驟驗證。"

msgid "User not found."
msgstr "找不到使用者。"

msgid "Please enter a username or user ID."
msgstr "請輸入使用者名稱或使用者 ID。"

msgid "Failed to read uploaded file."
msgstr "無法讀取上傳的檔案。"

msgid "Invalid upload."
msgstr "無效的上傳。"

msgid "File is empty or too large (max 100 MB)."
msgstr "檔案是空的或過大 (上限 100 MB)。"

msgid "Failed to upload the file. Try again."
msgstr "無法上傳檔案。請再試一次。"

msgid "You have submitted too many tickets today. Please try again tomorrow."
msgstr "你今天送出的技術支援單過多。請明天再試。"

msgid "A valid reply-to email is required."
msgstr "必須提供有效的回覆電子郵件地址。"

msgid "Message is required."
msgstr "必須填寫訊息。"

msgid "Permission denied."
msgstr "沒有權限。"

msgid "Other request"
msgstr "其他要求"

msgid "Missed malware report"
msgstr "漏偵測惡意軟體回報"

msgid "Plugin not found or no data to migrate."
msgstr "找不到外掛，或沒有可移轉的資料。"

msgid "Invalid IP address."
msgstr "無效的 IP 位址。"

msgid "Invalid backup reference."
msgstr "無效的備份參照。"

msgid "Backup integrity check failed — content hash does not match metadata."
msgstr "備份完整性檢查失敗 — 內容雜湊值與中繼資料不符。"

msgid "Backup file is corrupt — decompression failed."
msgstr "備份檔案已損毀 — 解壓縮失敗。"

msgid "Backup file is corrupt — decryption failed."
msgstr "備份檔案已損毀 — 解密失敗。"

msgid ""
"Backup file is unreadable. Check filesystem permissions on uploads/segurium-"
"data."
msgstr "無法讀取備份檔案。請檢查 uploads/segurium-data 的檔案系統權限。"

msgid "Backup metadata is missing or unreadable."
msgstr "備份中繼資料遺失或無法讀取。"

msgid "Backup is no longer available — it was rotated out by newer backups."
msgstr "備份已不存在 — 較新的備份已將它輪替移除。"

msgid "Failed to read file"
msgstr "無法讀取檔案"

msgid "Failed to delete file"
msgstr "無法刪除檔案"

msgid "Failed to create backup"
msgstr "無法建立備份"

msgid "Failed to read file for backup"
msgstr "無法讀取要備份的檔案"

msgid "Failed to write file"
msgstr "無法寫入檔案"

msgid "Failed to create directory"
msgstr "無法建立目錄"

msgid "Pending change not found or already expired."
msgstr "找不到待處理的變更，或它已過期。"

msgid "Unauthorized."
msgstr "未授權。"

msgid "Failed to compress file."
msgstr "無法壓縮檔案。"

msgid "File contents changed since the scan."
msgstr "檔案內容在掃描後已變更。"

msgid "File is too large to submit."
msgstr "檔案過大，無法送出。"

msgid "File not found on disk."
msgstr "在磁碟上找不到這個檔案。"

msgid "Protected file (exclusion list)."
msgstr "受保護的檔案 (排除清單)。"

msgid "Not from WordPress.org — integrity cannot be verified."
msgstr "並非來自 WordPress.org — 無法驗證完整性。"

msgid "Active abandoned theme — switch manually."
msgstr "使用中的已停止維護佈景主題 — 請手動切換。"

msgid "Theme \"%s\" is abandoned but currently active. It will be skipped."
msgstr "佈景主題「%s」已停止維護，但目前使用中，因此會略過。"

msgid "Delisted from WordPress.org"
msgstr "已從 WordPress.org 下架"

msgid "Cannot delete active theme. Switch first."
msgstr "無法刪除使用中的佈景主題。請先切換。"

msgid "%1$s \"%2$s\" has been restored from backup."
msgstr "已從備份還原 %1$s「%2$s」。"

msgid "%1$s \"%2$s\" has been deleted. A backup was created."
msgstr "已刪除 %1$s「%2$s」，並建立備份。"

msgid ""
"Cannot delete the currently active theme. Switch to a different theme first."
msgstr "無法刪除目前使用中的佈景主題。請先切換至其他佈景主題。"

msgid "Invalid parameters."
msgstr "無效的參數。"

msgid "File too large to view (>2 MB)"
msgstr "檔案過大，無法檢視 (超過 2 MB)"

msgid "Failed to write restored file"
msgstr "無法寫入還原的檔案"

msgid "Missing parameters."
msgstr "缺少參數。"

msgid "This endpoint has been removed. Please reload the page."
msgstr "這個端點已移除。請重新載入頁面。"

msgid "Unexpected error."
msgstr "非預期的錯誤。"

msgid "Unexpected error: %s"
msgstr "非預期的錯誤：%s"

msgid "No integrity scan is currently running."
msgstr "目前沒有正在執行的完整性掃描。"

msgid "Failed to read file."
msgstr "無法讀取檔案。"

msgid "File is too large to preview."
msgstr "檔案過大，無法預覽。"

msgid "File not found or not readable."
msgstr "找不到檔案或無法讀取。"

msgid "File is outside the WordPress root."
msgstr "檔案位於 WordPress 根目錄之外。"

msgid "File is not an active malware entry."
