msgstr "分鐘必須介於 0 至 59 之間。"

msgid "Hour must be between 0 and 23."
msgstr "小時必須介於 0 至 23 之間。"

msgid "Frequency must be one of: off, daily, weekly."
msgstr "頻率必須是下列其中之一：off、daily、weekly。"

msgid "Invalid settings payload."
msgstr "無效的設定內容。"

msgid "Scan trigger secret did not match."
msgstr "掃描觸發密鑰不符。"

msgid "Scan trigger requires authentication."
msgstr "掃描觸發需要驗證。"

msgid ""
"WordPress cron is disabled (DISABLE_WP_CRON). Scheduled scans depend on a "
"real system cron job hitting wp-cron.php every minute. Ask your host to set "
"one up."
msgstr ""
"WordPress cron 已停用 (DISABLE_WP_CRON)。排程掃描仰賴真正的系統 cron 工作每分鐘呼叫 wp-"
"cron.php。請要求你的主機商設定一個。"

msgid ""
"WordPress cron is disabled (DISABLE_WP_CRON) and your PHP setup has no way "
"to detach long tasks from page requests. Background scans will only progress"
" while a Segurium admin tab stays open. Ask your host to either enable a "
"real system cron job hitting wp-cron.php every minute, or to switch from "
"mod_php to PHP-FPM / LiteSpeed."
msgstr ""
"WordPress cron 已停用 (DISABLE_WP_CRON)，而且你的 PHP 環境無法將長時間工作與頁面要求分離。背景掃描只有在 "
"Segurium 管理分頁保持開啟時才會推進。請要求你的主機商啟用每分鐘呼叫 wp-cron.php 的真正系統 cron 工作，或是從 mod_php"
" 改為 PHP-FPM/LiteSpeed。"

msgid ""
"PHP max_execution_time is %ds — too short for reliable scanning. Ask your "
"host to raise it to at least 30s."
msgstr "PHP 的 max_execution_time 為 %d 秒 — 對可靠的掃描而言太短。請要求你的主機商將它提高到至少 30 秒。"

msgid "Could not fetch scan status due to a server error."
msgstr "因伺服器錯誤，無法取得掃描狀態。"

msgid "You do not have permission to manage scans."
msgstr "你沒有管理掃描的權限。"

msgid "Unexpected error starting scan: %s"
msgstr "開始掃描時發生非預期的錯誤：%s"

msgid "Failed to initialize scan: %s"
msgstr "無法初始化掃描：%s"

msgid ""
"Scan storage was not ready. It has been repaired automatically — please "
"click \"Start scan\" again."
msgstr "掃描儲存空間尚未就緒，現已自動修復 — 請再次點擊 [開始掃描]。"

msgid "A scan is already in progress."
msgstr "已有掃描進行中。"

msgid ""
"Scan storage is not ready. Please deactivate and reactivate the Segurium "
"plugin, then try again."
msgstr "掃描儲存空間尚未就緒。請停用 Segurium 外掛後重新啟用，然後再試一次。"

msgid ""
"Activation with the Segurium cloud service is still pending. Please try "
"again in a moment."
msgstr "與 Segurium 雲端服務的啟用作業仍在處理中。請稍候再試。"

msgid "A scan type is required."
msgstr "必須指定掃描類型。"

msgid "Every 60 seconds (Segurium scan rescue)"
msgstr "每 60 秒 (Segurium 掃描救援)"

msgid "Segurium realtime scan (every %d seconds, dev override)"
msgstr "Segurium 即時掃描 (每 %d 秒，開發用覆寫設定)"

msgid "Could not start the chained integrity scan: %s"
msgstr "無法開始接續的完整性掃描：%s"

msgid ""
"The chained malware scan was cancelled — integrity scan was not started."
msgstr "接續的惡意軟體掃描已取消 — 完整性掃描並未開始。"

msgid "Running a quick malware scan first…"
msgstr "正在先執行快速惡意軟體掃描…"

msgid ""
"Jetpack is active and requires XML-RPC. Disabling XML-RPC will break the "
"Jetpack connection."
msgstr "Jetpack 使用中，而它需要 XML-RPC。停用 XML-RPC 會讓 Jetpack 連線無法運作。"

msgid ""
"Your server uses FastCGI, which may re-add the X-Powered-By header. Verify "
"removal by inspecting response headers."
msgstr "你的伺服器使用 FastCGI，可能會重新加上 X-Powered-By 標頭。請檢視回應標頭以驗證是否已移除。"

msgid ""
"On IIS, use the removeServerHeader attribute in web.config. This toggle has "
"limited effect."
msgstr "在 IIS 上，請使用 web.config 中的 removeServerHeader 屬性。這個開關的效果有限。"

msgid ""
"On Apache with FastCGI, the Server header is added after PHP runs. Use "
"ServerTokens Prod in Apache config."
msgstr ""
"在搭配 FastCGI 的 Apache 上，Server 標頭會在 PHP 執行後才加上。請在 Apache 設定中使用 ServerTokens "
"Prod。"

msgid ""
"On Nginx, the Server header must be removed at the server level "
"(server_tokens off;). This toggle has no effect."
msgstr "在 Nginx 上，Server 標頭必須在伺服器層級移除 (server_tokens off;)。這個開關沒有作用。"

msgid ""
"Segurium could not activate the Pro license on this site because it is "
"currently bound to another installation. Please open the Segurium account "
"portal on the original installation and deactivate the license there; the "
"binding will be released and Pro features will re-activate here on the next "
"license check."
msgstr ""
"Segurium 無法在這個網站啟用 Pro 授權，因為它目前繫結至另一個安裝。請在原本的安裝上開啟 Segurium "
"帳號入口網站並在該處停用授權；繫結解除後，Pro 功能會在下次授權檢查時於這裡重新啟用。"

msgid ""
"Segurium detected this site was moved or cloned and is re-establishing its "
"secure connection in the background. If you have a Pro license, please re-"
"activate it on the Segurium account screen so Pro features are restored on "
"the new identity."
msgstr ""
"Segurium 偵測到這個網站已搬移或複製，正在背景重新建立安全連線。如果你持有 Pro 授權，請在 Segurium 帳號畫面重新啟用它，讓 Pro"
" 功能在新的識別身分上恢復。"

msgid "Failed to install geo DB."
msgstr "無法安裝地理位置資料庫。"

